        <mxCell id="baseReply" value="&lt;b&gt;Tutor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sure. A year is a leap year if it is divisible by 4, unless it is divisible by 100; century years must also be divisible by 400.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5b3d70&quot;&gt;Helpful, but leaking · complete rule revealed&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=callout;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=15;position=0.5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b0bec5;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=16;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;" vertex="1" parent="basePanel">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="540" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="adapterReply" value="&lt;b&gt;Tutor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;“I cannot provide a completed solution.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What rule do you know, and what is one exception?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5b3d70&quot;&gt;Boundary + diagnosis + next step&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=callout;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=15;position=0.5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b0bec5;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=16;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;" vertex="1" parent="adapterPanel">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="540" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

